; typesweep.eval - a FEATURE type renamed takes its records with it and is not
; deleted while any are placed; a type whose id is the CODE's (an effect, an
; attack, a spell, the balance sheet) is refused both; and catround's cases
; (code-review C305, C306, C323). Judged by tools/EditorTest.py phase 21.
;
; EditorTest writes, before this runs (into its scratch world, never the real
; one): `floorfeature recess 7 7` and `ceilingfeature vault 7 7` on crypt1, a
; level NOT loaded, so the sweep has to reach a level's file as well as the
; level in hand.
;
; 1. The arena bare, then with two recesses and a vault: the geometry has to
;    MOVE, or "the same after the rename" below would prove nothing.
; 2. recess -> sunk and vault -> dome: every record follows on both levels, and
;    the geometry is exactly what it was - the tiles are still found under
;    their new names. A delete of either is refused while they are placed.
;    savemap writes both levels for the judge to read.
; 3. Renames and deletes of ids the code owns are refused, and the type editor
;    opened on an effect answers a Delete with why, instead of arming it.
; 4. catround: every file of the world round-trips, and its three cases pass.

logecho on
reset
echo --- 1: features placed ---
geomhash
editor place surfacefeatures recess 5 5
editor place surfacefeatures recess 6 5
editor place surfacefeatures vault 8 5
geomhash
typerefs surfacefeatures recess
typerefs surfacefeatures vault
echo --- 2: renamed ---
typeset rename surfacefeatures recess sunk
typeset rename surfacefeatures vault dome
typerefs surfacefeatures recess
typerefs surfacefeatures sunk
typerefs surfacefeatures dome
geomhash
typeset delete surfacefeatures sunk
typeset delete surfacefeatures dome
savemap
echo --- 3: the code's ids ---
typeset rename effects burn burn_x
typeset rename attacks stab stab_x
typeset rename spells flame flame_x
typeset rename balance formula formula_x
typeset delete effects burn
typeset delete attacks stab
typeset delete spells flame
typeset delete balance formula
typeset dialog effects burn
typeset dialog delete
typeset dialog off
echo --- 4: catround ---
catround
